---

This software produces analytical output about public blockchain data. It is
not investment advice, it does not identify the natural persons behind
addresses, and it makes no claim that any address is an "insider". Reports are
generated from public RPC endpoints and the DexScreener public API; accuracy
depends on those third-party services and on the block range scanned.
